### Create Upcoming Event

This endpoint allows superadmins to create a new upcoming event.

#### Request Body

- form-data

    - trailer (file): optional: The trailer for the upcoming event.

    - portraitPhoto (file): The portrait photo for the upcoming event.

    - landscapePhoto (file): The landscape photo for the upcoming event.

    - data (text): Additional data for the upcoming event. See Docs for required format.


All files are to be mounted directly on the formDate object. Non files are to be JSON.stringified and mounted on formdata.data property.

When merged on the server, the object must pass the validation below. All feilds are required except **active.**

data.trailer and data.trailerLink are optional, but only One may be provided at a time

``` javascript
Joi.object({
  title: STRING_SCHEMA.required(),
  type: STRING_SCHEMA.valid('movie', 'series', 'music video', 'documentary', 'skit').required(),
  details: STRING_SCHEMA.required(),
  releaseDate: ISO_STRING_SCHEMA.required(),
  active: Joi.boolean(),
  trailerLink: STRING_SCHEMA,
  trailer: Joi.object(),
  portraitPhoto: Joi.object().required(),
  landscapePhoto: Joi.object().required(),
})

 ```

#### Response

